comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-02T23:03:26.452Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-02: keyword and semantic searches across all statuses found pm-3yxwv5 for the read-time vocabulary, pm-mf4j for generic positional config UX, pm-9byd for earlier scalar config exposure, and pm-v68d for narrow MCP config. None owns typed agent probe/vocabulary mutation; created as the operator-facing follow-up discovered while dogfooding the live 43,561-entry residual report."
  "2026-08-03T11:09:28.654Z","harness:codex","Organization 2026-08-03: assigned to schema and universal configuration because this item owns operator-visible settings plus SDK mutation parity. Estimate 360 minutes covers typed CLI and SDK reads/writes, audited vocabulary revisioning, completions, MCP parity, sparse settings compatibility, docs, and isolated consumer tests. Risk is medium and confidence high because the underlying probe and vocabulary primitives already shipped."
